sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Patient / Clinician
    participant UI as Streamlit UI (app.py)
    participant Engine as Inference Engine (ml/predictor.py)
    participant ML as Scikit-Learn Model (.joblib)
    participant KB as Disease Knowledge Base (ml/disease_db.py)
    participant PDF as PDF Generator (utils/streamlit_pdf.py)

    User->>UI: Select Symptoms (e.g. ["skin_rash", "itching"])
    UI->>Engine: predict(input_symptoms, model_name)
    Engine->>Engine: Construct 132-dim Binary Feature Vector
    Engine->>ML: model.predict_proba(vector)
    ML-->>Engine: Class Probabilities Distribution Array
    Engine->>Engine: Sort & Rank Top 3 Probable Prognoses
    Engine->>KB: Query Disease Info (Description, Precautions, Doctor)
    KB-->>Engine: Return Enriched Clinical Information
    Engine-->>UI: Return Structured Diagnostic Dictionary
    UI->>User: Render Risk Badge, Confidence Gauge, Differentials & Precautions
    opt PDF Report Download
        User->>UI: Click "Download Clinical PDF Health Report"
        UI->>PDF: generate_health_report_pdf(result)
        PDF-->>UI: Return Formatted PDF Bytes
        UI-->>User: Trigger Browser File Download
    end
